<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>EntreNos</title>
<link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 64 64'><path d='M32 54C16 40 8 32 8 22c0-7 5-11 11-10 6 1 11 7 13 12 2-5 7-11 13-12 6-1 11 3 11 10 0 10-8 18-24 32z' fill='none' stroke='%23E8735A' stroke-width='5' stroke-linejoin='round'/></svg>">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,500;9..144,600;9..144,700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Pacifico&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@supabase/supabase-js@2"></script>
<style>
  /* ============================================================
     🎨 PALETA PASTEL
     ============================================================ */
  :root{
    --paper:#FBF4EC; --ink:#2E3150; --muted:#8A85A0; --card:#FFFFFF; --line:#EFE6DC;
    --radius:20px; --shadow:0 14px 34px -18px rgba(46,49,80,.24); --shadow-sm:0 6px 18px -10px rgba(46,49,80,.18);
    --brand:#E8735A;                                   /* coral: marca */
    --food:#7FB287; --food-soft:#E7F2E7; --food-dark:#3F7A46;   /* verde: comer */
    --move:#A99BD6; --move-soft:#ECE6F8; --move-dark:#6A5AA0;   /* lavanda: moverme */
    --feel:#E9A96B; --feel-soft:#FBECD9; --feel-dark:#B57327;   /* durazno: sentir */
    --myth:#E8735A; --myth-soft:#FBE3DC; --myth-dark:#C24A34;   /* coral: mitos */
    --chat:#7FA8CC; --chat-soft:#E3EDF6; --chat-dark:#3E6E94;   /* azul: preguntar */
    --nav-h:74px;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box} html,body{margin:0;padding:0}
  body{font-family:'Inter',system-ui,sans-serif;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);line-height:1.55;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;padding-bottom:calc(var(--nav-h) + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));position:relative}
  h1,h2,h3{font-family:'Fraunces',Georgia,serif;line-height:1.12;margin:0;letter-spacing:-.01em}
  button{font-family:inherit;cursor:pointer;border:none;background:none;color:inherit}
  .wrap{max-width:720px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 20px;position:relative;z-index:1}
  .ico{width:24px;height:24px;display:block;stroke:currentColor;fill:none;stroke-width:1.8;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}
  .wordmark{font-family:'Pacifico',cursive;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:.5px}
  .wordmark .nos{color:var(--brand)}

  /* ---------- Fondos orgánicos ---------- */
  .bg-blobs{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:0;overflow:hidden;pointer-events:none}
  .blob{position:absolute;border-radius:52% 48% 50% 50%/50% 52% 48% 50%;opacity:.4;filter:blur(4px)}
  .b1{width:280px;height:260px;background:#F7D8CE;top:-90px;left:-80px}
  .b2{width:240px;height:230px;background:#E3DAF4;top:-70px;right:-70px}
  .b3{width:260px;height:250px;background:#DCEEDD;bottom:60px;left:-90px}
  .b4{width:230px;height:220px;background:#FBE6CF;bottom:-40px;right:-70px}

  /* ---------- Bienvenida ---------- */
  #gate{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:80;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:24px;overflow:hidden;
    background:linear-gradient(160deg,#F6C5B6 0%,#D8CBF0 52%,#F8DFC0 120%);transition:opacity .5s ease}
  #gate.hide{opacity:0;pointer-events:none}
  #gate .gblob{position:absolute;border-radius:50%;opacity:.5;filter:blur(2px)}
  .gate-card{background:var(--card);border-radius:30px;padding:38px 28px;max-width:400px;width:100%;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 40px 90px -30px rgba(0,0,0,.45);position:relative;z-index:1}
  .gate-logo{width:76px;height:76px;margin:0 auto 12px;color:var(--brand)}
  .gate-card h1{font-size:44px;margin-bottom:12px}
  .gate-tagline{display:inline-block;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#5B4E7A;background:linear-gradient(transparent 55%,#E3DAF4 55%);padding:0 6px;margin:0 0 20px}
  .gate-card input{width:100%;padding:15px 16px;border-radius:14px;border:1.5px solid var(--line);font-size:16px;font-family:inherit;text-align:center;margin-bottom:14px;background:#FDFAF6}
  .gate-card input:focus{outline:none;border-color:var(--brand)}
  .btn-primary{background:var(--ink);color:#fff;padding:15px 22px;border-radius:14px;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;width:100%;transition:transform .15s ease}
  .btn-primary:active{transform:scale(.98)}

  /* ---------- Encabezado ---------- */
  header.hero{padding:28px 0 8px}
  .brandrow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;margin-bottom:14px}
  .brandrow .logo{width:30px;height:30px;color:var(--brand)}
  .brandrow .name{font-family:'Pacifico',cursive;font-size:24px;color:var(--ink)}
  .brandrow .name .nos{color:var(--brand)}
  .greet{font-size:25px;font-weight:600}
  .greet .accent{color:var(--brand)}
  .affirm{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;padding:14px 16px;margin-top:14px;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm)}
  .affirm .spark{color:var(--brand);flex:none;margin-top:1px} .affirm .spark .ico{width:20px;height:20px}
  .affirm span.t{font-size:14.5px;font-weight:500;color:#5C5670}

  section.panel{display:none;padding:16px 0 24px;animation:fade .35s ease} section.panel.on{display:block}
  @keyframes fade{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(8px)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}
  .eyebrow{font-weight:700;font-size:11.5px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:5px}
  .eyebrow.food{color:var(--food-dark)}.eyebrow.move{color:var(--move-dark)}.eyebrow.feel{color:var(--feel-dark)}.eyebrow.myth{color:var(--myth-dark)}.eyebrow.chat{color:var(--chat-dark)}
  h2.big{font-size:27px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:6px}
  .lead{color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 20px;font-size:14.5px;max-width:52ch}

  .filterbar{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-bottom:16px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .chip{background:var(--card);border:1.5px solid var(--line);border-radius:100px;padding:8px 15px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#726C86;transition:.15s ease}
  .chip.on{background:var(--ink);color:#fff;border-color:var(--ink)}

  /* ---------- Recetas ---------- */
  .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:14px}
  @media(min-width:620px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}
  .recipe{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);overflow:hidden;box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm)}
  .recipe .band{height:6px;background:var(--food)} .recipe .body{padding:18px}
  .recipe .row{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px}
  .recipe h3{font-size:19px;font-weight:600} .recipe .why{color:var(--muted);font-size:13.5px;margin:6px 0 12px}
  .fav{flex:none;color:#D7CEDD;transition:.18s ease;padding:2px} .fav .ico{width:23px;height:23px} .fav.on{color:var(--brand)} .fav.on .ico{fill:var(--brand)}
  .tag{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;background:var(--food-soft);color:var(--food-dark);font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;padding:4px 11px;border-radius:100px;margin-bottom:10px;letter-spacing:.02em}
  details{border-top:1px solid var(--line);margin-top:4px;padding-top:10px}
  summary{font-weight:700;font-size:13px;cursor:pointer;color:var(--food-dark);list-style:none;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}
  summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
  summary .chev{transition:transform .2s ease} details[open] summary .chev{transform:rotate(90deg)}
  .recipe ul,.recipe ol{margin:10px 0 0;padding-left:18px;font-size:14px} .recipe li{margin:4px 0}
  .cmt{margin-top:14px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:12px}
  .cmt label{font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:var(--muted);display:block;margin-bottom:6px;letter-spacing:.02em}
  .cmt textarea{width:100%;border:1.5px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:10px 12px;font-family:inherit;font-size:13.5px;resize:vertical;min-height:46px;background:#FDFAF6}
  .cmt textarea:focus{outline:none;border-color:var(--food)}
  .saved{font-size:12px;color:var(--food-dark);font-weight:700;opacity:0;transition:.3s} .saved.show{opacity:1}

  /* ---------- Rutinas ---------- */
  .routine{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm);padding:18px;margin-bottom:14px}
  .routine h3{font-size:19px;font-weight:600;color:var(--move-dark)} .routine .meta{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin:4px 0 14px}
  .routine ol{margin:0;padding-left:20px;font-size:14.5px} .routine li{margin:6px 0}
  .timer{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-top:16px;background:var(--move-soft);border-radius:14px;padding:12px 14px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .timer .clock{font-family:'Fraunces';font-size:30px;font-weight:600;color:var(--move-dark);min-width:74px;text-align:center;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
  .timer button{background:var(--move);color:#fff;font-weight:600;padding:10px 18px;border-radius:11px;font-size:14px}
  .timer button.ghost{background:#fff;color:var(--move-dark);border:1.5px solid var(--move)}
  .note{background:#FBECD9;border:1px solid #F1DBB8;border-radius:14px;padding:14px 16px;font-size:13.5px;color:#9A6A22;margin-top:6px;display:flex;gap:10px} .note .ico{flex:none;color:#C98F2F;width:20px;height:20px;margin-top:1px} .note b{color:#875C16}

  /* ---------- Emociones ---------- */
  .moodpick{display:flex;gap:9px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:8px 0 16px}
  .moodpick button{background:var(--card);border:1.5px solid var(--line);border-radius:100px;padding:10px 16px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#726C86;transition:.15s ease}
  .moodpick button.on{border-color:var(--feel);background:var(--feel-soft);color:var(--feel-dark)}
  .moodmsg{background:var(--feel-soft);border-radius:16px;padding:16px 18px;font-weight:500;color:var(--feel-dark);font-size:14.5px;display:none} .moodmsg.show{display:block;animation:fade .3s ease}
  .breath-wrap{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;text-align:center;background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm);padding:28px 24px;margin:18px 0}
  .breath-wrap h3{font-size:19px;font-weight:600;color:var(--feel-dark)}
  .orb{width:116px;height:116px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle at 36% 30%,#F5CB9C,#E9A96B);margin:14px 0 6px;box-shadow:0 12px 30px -8px rgba(233,169,107,.55)} .orb.run{animation:breathe 11s ease-in-out infinite}
  @keyframes breathe{0%{transform:scale(.66)}36%{transform:scale(1.12)}64%{transform:scale(1.12)}100%{transform:scale(.66)}}
  .breath-label{font-family:'Fraunces';font-weight:600;font-size:19px;color:var(--feel-dark);margin-top:10px;min-height:26px}
  .breath-wrap button{margin-top:16px;background:var(--feel);color:#fff;font-weight:600;padding:11px 22px;border-radius:12px;font-size:15px}
  .help{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-left:4px solid var(--feel);border-radius:16px;padding:20px;margin-top:8px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm)}
  .help h3{font-size:19px;font-weight:600;color:var(--feel-dark);margin-bottom:8px} .help ul{margin:12px 0 0;padding-left:20px;font-size:14.5px} .help li{margin:7px 0}
  .help .lines{background:var(--feel-soft);border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin-top:14px;font-size:14px} .help .lines b{display:block;margin-bottom:5px;color:var(--feel-dark)}
  .placeholder{color:var(--myth-dark);font-weight:700}

  /* ---------- Mitos ---------- */
  .myths{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:14px} @media(min-width:620px){.myths{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}
  .mcard{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm);padding:18px;cursor:pointer;transition:.18s ease}
  .mcard:active{transform:scale(.99)}
  .mcat{display:inline-block;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:700;padding:4px 11px;border-radius:100px;margin-bottom:10px;background:var(--myth-soft);color:var(--myth-dark);letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase}
  .mcard .q{font-family:'Fraunces';font-weight:600;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3} .mtap{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--myth-dark);font-weight:700;margin-top:10px}
  .mreveal{display:none;margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:12px} .mcard.open .mreveal{display:block;animation:fade .3s ease} .mcard.open .mtap{display:none}
  .verdict{font-family:'Fraunces';font-weight:700;font-size:17px} .verdict.v{color:var(--food-dark)} .verdict.m{color:var(--myth-dark)}
  .mexplain{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:5px}

  /* ---------- Chat Semi ---------- */
  .chatbox{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm);overflow:hidden}
  .chatlog{padding:18px;min-height:220px;max-height:380px;overflow-y:auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
  .bub{max-width:86%;padding:12px 15px;border-radius:16px;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.5}
  .bub.bot{background:var(--chat-soft);color:var(--chat-dark);border-bottom-left-radius:5px;align-self:flex-start}
  .bub.me{background:var(--ink);color:#fff;border-bottom-right-radius:5px;align-self:flex-end}
  .suggests{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:0 16px 14px}
  .suggests button{background:#fff;border:1.5px solid var(--chat);color:var(--chat-dark);border-radius:100px;padding:9px 14px;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;text-align:left;transition:.15s ease}
  .suggests button:active{background:var(--chat-soft)}
  .chatform{display:flex;gap:8px;padding:14px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);background:#FDFAF6}
  .chatform input{flex:1;border:1.5px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:12px 14px;font-size:15px;font-family:inherit;background:#fff}
  .chatform input:focus{outline:none;border-color:var(--chat)}
  .chatform button{background:var(--chat);color:#fff;font-weight:600;padding:0 18px;border-radius:14px;font-size:15px}
  .safetybar{background:var(--chat-soft);border-radius:14px;padding:14px 16px;font-size:13px;color:var(--chat-dark);margin-bottom:16px;display:flex;gap:10px} .safetybar .ico{flex:none;width:20px;height:20px;margin-top:1px} .safetybar b{color:#2A5578}

  /* ---------- Navegación inferior ---------- */
  .bottomnav{position:fixed;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;z-index:70;background:rgba(251,244,236,.92);backdrop-filter:blur(12px);border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-bottom:env(safe-area-inset-bottom)}
  .bottomnav .inner{max-width:520px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;height:var(--nav-h)}
  .bottomnav button{flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:4px;color:#6E6684;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:600;transition:.15s ease}
  .bottomnav button .ico{width:23px;height:23px;transition:.15s ease}
  .bottomnav button[data-k="food"].on{color:var(--food-dark)}
  .bottomnav button[data-k="move"].on{color:var(--move-dark)}
  .bottomnav button[data-k="feel"].on{color:var(--feel-dark)}
  .bottomnav button[data-k="myth"].on{color:var(--myth-dark)}
  .bottomnav button[data-k="chat"].on{color:var(--chat-dark)}
  .bottomnav button.on .ico{transform:translateY(-2px)}

  footer{padding:8px 0 20px;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;text-align:center}
  footer .tagline{font-family:'Pacifico',cursive;font-size:16px;color:var(--brand);display:block;margin-bottom:8px}
  .dbflag{font-size:11px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted);padding:6px}
  .reset{background:none;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:underline;font-size:12px;margin-top:4px}
  @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="bg-blobs" aria-hidden="true"><div class="blob b1"></div><div class="blob b2"></div><div class="blob b3"></div><div class="blob b4"></div></div>

<!-- ===== Bienvenida ===== -->
<div id="gate">
  <div class="gblob" style="width:150px;height:150px;background:#F2B8A6;top:8%;left:6%"></div>
  <div class="gblob" style="width:120px;height:120px;background:#CFC0EC;bottom:12%;right:8%"></div>
  <div class="gblob" style="width:90px;height:90px;background:#C9E4CB;top:16%;right:16%"></div>
  <div class="gate-card">
    <svg class="gate-logo" viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
      <path d="M32 54C16 40 8 32 8 22c0-7 5-11 11-10 6 1 11 7 13 12 2-5 7-11 13-12 6-1 11 3 11 10 0 10-8 18-24 32z"/>
      <path d="M14 30c-6 3-8 10-5 15"/><path d="M50 30c6 3 8 10 5 15"/>
    </svg>
    <h1 class="wordmark">Entre<span class="nos">Nos</span></h1>
    <span class="gate-tagline">Un espacio para cuidarnos mientras crecemos</span>
    <input id="nameInput" type="text" placeholder="Tu nombre" maxlength="24" autocomplete="off">
    <button class="btn-primary" id="enterBtn">Entrar</button>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="wrap">
  <header class="hero">
    <div class="brandrow">
      <svg class="logo" viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
        <path d="M32 54C16 40 8 32 8 22c0-7 5-11 11-10 6 1 11 7 13 12 2-5 7-11 13-12 6-1 11 3 11 10 0 10-8 18-24 32z"/>
        <path d="M14 30c-6 3-8 10-5 15"/><path d="M50 30c6 3 8 10 5 15"/>
      </svg>
      <span class="name">Entre<span class="nos">Nos</span></span>
    </div>
    <div class="greet">Hola, <span class="accent" id="who">amig@</span></div>
    <div class="affirm">
      <span class="spark"><svg class="ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3l1.6 4.8L18 9.4l-4.4 1.6L12 16l-1.6-5L6 9.4l4.4-1.6z"/></svg></span>
      <span class="t" id="affirmText">Estás justo donde necesitas estar hoy.</span>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="panel on" data-p="food">
    <div class="eyebrow food">Comer para crecer</div>
    <h2 class="big">Recetas para tu energía</h2>
    <p class="lead">Comer bien no es comer menos: es darle a tu cuerpo lo que necesita para crecer, concentrarte y tener energía. Guarda tus favoritas y deja tus notas.</p>
    <div class="filterbar" id="filters">
      <button class="chip on" data-f="all">Todas</button>
      <button class="chip" data-f="fav">Mis favoritas</button>
      <button class="chip" data-f="rapido">Rápidas</button>
      <button class="chip" data-f="dulce">Dulces sanas</button>
    </div>
    <div class="grid" id="recipes"></div>
  </section>

  <section class="panel" data-p="move">
    <div class="eyebrow move">Moverme con gusto</div>
    <h2 class="big">Rutinas para sentirte bien</h2>
    <p class="lead">Nos movemos por salud, energía y porque se siente bien, no para cambiar cómo nos vemos. Empieza suave, respeta tu cuerpo y descansa cuando lo necesites.</p>
    <div class="note"><svg class="ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 8v4M12 16h.01"/></svg><div><b>Antes de empezar:</b> ropa cómoda, agua cerca y movimientos sin dolor. Si algo duele o te cuesta respirar, para y descansa.</div></div>
    <div id="routines" style="margin-top:16px"></div>
  </section>

  <section class="panel" data-p="feel">
    <div class="eyebrow feel">Cómo me siento</div>
    <h2 class="big">Tus emociones importan</h2>
    <p class="lead">Todas las emociones son válidas, incluso las difíciles. Aquí puedes hacer una pausa, respirar y saber qué hacer si necesitas apoyo.</p>
    <h3 style="font-size:16px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:4px">¿Cómo te sientes ahora?</h3>
    <div class="moodpick" id="moodpick">
      <button data-m="feliz">Feliz</button>
      <button data-m="tranquilo">Tranquil@</button>
      <button data-m="cansado">Cansad@</button>
      <button data-m="preocupado">Preocupad@</button>
      <button data-m="triste">Triste</button>
      <button data-m="molesto">Molest@</button>
    </div>
    <div class="moodmsg" id="moodmsg"></div>
    <div class="breath-wrap">
      <h3>Respiración para calmarte</h3>
      <p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:13.5px;margin:6px 0 0">Sigue el círculo: inhala, sostén y suelta despacio.</p>
      <div class="orb" id="orb"></div>
      <div class="breath-label" id="breathLabel">Presiona empezar</div>
      <button id="breathBtn">Empezar</button>
    </div>
    <div class="help">
      <h3>Si necesitas ayuda, no estás sol@</h3>
      <p style="font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);margin:0">Pedir ayuda es de valientes. Si algo te preocupa mucho, te sientes en peligro o llevas varios días sintiéndote muy mal, habla con alguien en quien confíes:</p>
      <ul>
